{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.CechNerveValues","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.CechNerveValues","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.CechNerveTetrahedron"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.nval_pull","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.nval_pull","kind":"theorem","line":184,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveValues.lean#L184-L193","doc":"**Values pull back by reindexing.** For a refinement `f : W j ⟶ U (r j)` of\n`ConnFamily` families, the value of the pulled-back cocycle on a nonempty\ntriple of `W` is the value of the original cocycle on the image triple. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.nval_ofNval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.nval_ofNval","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveValues.lean#L177-L182","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.ofNval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.ofNval","kind":"def","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveValues.lean#L163-L174","doc":"The cocycle with constant components `V i j k`, from a function on triples\nsatisfying the cocycle identity on every nonempty quadruple. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.class_eq_one_iff_nval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.class_eq_one_iff_nval","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveValues.lean#L146-L161","doc":"The class of a cocycle on a `ConnFamily` is trivial exactly when its values\nare a coboundary of a function on pairs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.rel_iff_nval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.rel_iff_nval","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveValues.lean#L118-L144","doc":"**Cohomology on values.** Two cocycles on a `ConnFamily` are cohomologous\nexactly when their values differ by the coboundary of a function on pairs, on\nevery nonempty triple. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.nconstOneCochain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.nconstOneCochain","kind":"def","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveValues.lean#L113-L116","doc":"The constant 1-cochain with values `w i j`, on any index type. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.nval_cocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.nval_cocycle","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveValues.lean#L94-L111","doc":"The cocycle identity on values, on every quadruple with nonempty\nintersection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.nev1_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.nev1_apply","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveValues.lean#L83-L92","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExte